# Test harness: solc/ethers/ganache are pulled per-checkout, and artifacts.json is
# regenerated by `npm test` on every run. The committed .abi/.bin at the repo root are
# the release artifacts and ARE tracked - those are what the indexer consumes.
# test/package-lock.json is tracked: with it, `npm ci` installs the exact packages the
# tests were last run with, on every checkout.
test/node_modules/
test/artifacts.json
